{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=2, [4,1,0]⊗[4,1,0]: pole-set chain conjecture (A3 iii of `site1-Qform/7-undo-site2-rotation-span.md` §14), 2026-10-09\n\n**Goal (Paul).** Test the pole-set chain conjecture for $\\Lambda=[4,1,0]$ (gl(3), L=2, dim 24, 576 states, 15 HW states): the product points of $\\langle\\Omega_w\\otimes\\Omega_w|(c_0+\\sum_\\lambda c_\\lambda T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-\\lambda_1h))$ are indexed by pole sets $P_k=\\{0..k\\}$, $k=2..\\lambda_1$, with $y_k=w_2(\\theta_{12}-h)/(\\theta_{12}-kh)$, overlap $\\det_6\\times\\det_2^{(P_k)}[y_k]/M$, dressing order $\\lambda_1-k+1$ on the partner site; per-weight completeness for $k<\\lambda_1$, one direction short for $k=\\lambda_1$.\n\n**Recipe** (as in the [3,1,0], [3,2,0] notebooks): (1) localization of $T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-4h)$ on $\\langle\\Omega|$; (2) exact product locus; (3) identify the factors; (4) Q-side: eigenstates, Q's, vacuum triple, minor, det$_2^{(P)}$ curves; (5) undo of the site-2 rotation, per-weight ranks, HW determination; (6) end-to-end checks.\n\n**Conventions.** New conventions, plain GT generators `JJ`, Lax $(u-\\theta_s)\\delta+hE$, twist on the right, CBR fusion, shapes by row lengths. Numeric point P1: $h=1/2$, $\\theta=(2/7,-3/5)$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$, $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$. Globals prefixed `u21`. Runs on the shared default kernel K1 (cell 2 does a `ClearAll`).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state for this notebook (shared default kernel K1: this ClearAll wipes the live state of the other open notebooks; their files are intact). Quiet: ClearAll warns about the protected Wolfbook helper symbols, which stay untouched. *)\nQuiet[ClearAll[\"Global`*\"]];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>;\n(* rep, numeric point P1, sparse exact generators *)\nΛ = {4, 1, 0}; nL = 2; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^nL;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; zN = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; wN = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}; θ12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]];\nid1 = IdentityMatrix[d1, SparseArray]; id2 = IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, Λ]];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], id1]; E2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[id1, Ee[i, j]];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nsecOf[μ_] := secOf[μ] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1]; kron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\n(* exp of a nilpotent matrix: finite sum from the identity (MatrixPower[nilpotent, 0] errors) *)\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 2 (Λ[[1]] - Λ[[3]])}];\nnuP[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, nL}];\nGrid[{{\"Λ\", Λ}, {\"dims (one site, two sites)\", {d1, d2}}, {\"# weight sectors\", Length[Union[wtBasis]]}, {\"HW pattern = index 1\", ps[{Λ}][[1]]}, {\"e1.E12, e1.E21 nonzero?\", {Norm[Normal[e1 . Ee[1, 2]]] != 0, Norm[Normal[e1 . Ee[2, 1]]] != 0}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"169\" data-out-n=\"1039\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"27\" data-sub-end=\"27\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1039]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dims (one site, two sites)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># weight sectors</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HW pattern = index 1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">e1.E12, e1.E21 nonzero?</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">225</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1039]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\Lambda  & \\left\\{3,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{dims (one site, two sites)} & \\left\\{15,225\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# weight sectors} & 36\\\\\\hline\\text{HW pattern = index 1} & \\left\\{\\left\\{3\\right\\},\\left\\{3,2\\right\\},\\left\\{3,2,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{e1.E12, e1.E21 nonzero?} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{False}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
