  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* localization at v0 = θ1 - 4h for every CBR shape with λ1 ≤ 4 (row-length labels), and the site-2 span. Covector <Ω|T_λ as the 24x24 matrix M[a,b], a = site 1, b = site 2: its ROWS are the site-2 covectors. Site-1 local <=> rank 1 with site-2 factor Ω1 (expected for [4,1,0]: (1,1), (2,2), (3,3), (4,3)). Rank 0 means <Ω|T_λ vanishes identically. *)\nshapes = Select[Flatten[Table[{a, b}, {a, 0, 4}, {b, 0, a}], 1], # =!= {0, 0} &];\n{tT, Tv0} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[λ -> TL2[λ, v0, Zd], {λ, shapes}]]];\nMl[λ_] := Ml[λ] = Partition[Normal[Ω2 . Tv0[λ]], d1];\nrowSpaceDim[M_] := MatrixRank[M];\nextraDim[M_] := MatrixRank[Join[M, {Ω1}]] - MatrixRank[M];   (* 0 iff Ω1 lies in the site-2 span of M *)\nlocTab = Table[With[{M = Ml[λ]}, {λ, rowSpaceDim[M], extraDim[M], rowSpaceDim[M] == 1 && extraDim[M] == 0}], {λ, shapes}];\nlocShapes = Select[shapes, locTab[[Position[shapes, #][[1, 1]], 4]] &]; nonLoc = Complement[shapes, locShapes];\nrJoint = MatrixRank[Join[{Ω1}, Flatten[Table[Ml[λ], {λ, shapes}], 1]]];\nrNonLocEach = Table[{λ, MatrixRank[Join[{Ω1}, Ml[λ]]]}, {λ, nonLoc}];\nzeroShapes = Select[shapes, Union[Flatten[Ml[#]]] === {0} &];\nchecks[\"localizing shapes at θ1-4h\"] = locShapes;\nchecks[\"shapes with <Ω|T_λ = 0\"] = zeroShapes;\nchecks[\"joint site-2 span dim (Ω1 + all shapes)\"] = rJoint;\nGrid[Join[{{\"shape\", \"rank of <Ω|T_λ (24x24)\", \"Ω1 outside its site-2 span? (0 = inside)\", \"site-1 local\"}}, locTab, {{\"localizing shapes\", locShapes, \"\", \"\"}, {\"shapes with <Ω|T_λ = 0\", zeroShapes, \"\", \"\"}, {\"joint site-2 span dim (Ω1 + all shapes)\", rJoint, \"\", \"\"}, {\"dim(Ω1 + site-2 span of each non-local shape)\", rNonLocEach, \"\", \"\"}, {\"T time (s)\", tT, \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"172\" data-out-n=\"1091\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1091]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:28.8401em;vertical-align:-14.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-16.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:28.8001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-14.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-19.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shape</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-17.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><