-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-27.7001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-28.9001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-30.1001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-31.3001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1091]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{shape} & \\text{rank of <$\\Omega$|T\\_$\\lambda$ (15x15)} & \\text{$\\Omega$1 outside its site-2 span? (0 = inside)} & \\text{site-1 local}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,0\\right\\} & 2 & 0 & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & 1 & 0 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,0\\right\\} & 2 & 0 & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & 1 & 0 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & 0 & 1 & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,0\\right\\} & 2 & 0 & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,1\\right\\} & 1 & 0 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & 0 & 1 & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3\\right\\} & 0 & 1 & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\text{localizing shapes} & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1\\\\2 & 1\\\\3 & 1\\end{pmatrix} &  & \\\\\\hline\\text{shapes with <$\\Omega$|T\\_$\\lambda$ = 0} & \\begin{pmatrix}2 & 2\\\\3 & 2\\\\3 & 3\\end{pmatrix} &  & \\\\\\hline\\text{joint site-2 span dim ($\\Omega$1 + all shapes)} & 2 &  & \\\\\\hline\\text{dim($\\Omega$1 + site-2 span of each non-local shape)} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{1,0\\right\\} & 2\\\\\\left\\{2,0\\right\\} & 2\\\\\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & 1\\\\\\left\\{3,0\\right\\} & 2\\\\\\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & 1\\\\\\left\\{3,3\\right\\} & 1\\end{pmatrix} &  & \\\\\\hline\\text{T time (s)} & 0.505699 &  & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "966440e9-6ae0-4c10-840d-47d1439379de"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* site-2 directions beyond Ω1 and the exact product locus in the linear span Φ(c) = <Ω|(c0 + Σ_λ c_λ T_λ(θ1-4h)). Basis β of the joint site-2 span: Ω1 first, then greedily the rows of the non-local <Ω|T_λ that raise the rank (each normalized by its largest entry). Each M_λ = Σ_j A_{λj} ⊗ β_j; Φ(c) is a product iff the r site-1 vectors a_j(c) = Σ_k c_k A_{kj} are all parallel (2x2 minors of the r x 24 matrix vanish). Shapes whose <Ω|T_λ vanishes identically ((4,4) here) have a free, irrelevant coefficient and are dropped from the Solve. *)\nallMats = Join[{Partition[Ω2, d1]}, Table[Ml[λ], {λ, shapes}]];   (* k = 1: identity; k = 2..: shapes *)\nopNames = Join[{\"1\"}, (\"T\" <> ToString[#] &) /@ shapes];\nβbasis = Module[{b = {Ω1}}, Do[If[MatrixRank[Append[b, row]] > Length[b], AppendTo[b, row/row[[Ordering[Abs[row], -1][[1]]]]]], {row, Flatten[Table[Ml[λ], {λ, nonLoc}], 1]}]; b];\nrB = Length[βbasis]; checks[\"joint site-2 span: dim\"] = rB;\n(* the extra direction(s): rotations? is the pencil Ω1 + κω inside the rotation orbit? is ω a one-site vacuum Ω_{(p,q)} for (p,q) among the twist parameters (pairs singular in rOm excluded)? *)\nextras = Rest[βbasis];\nvacCands = Select[DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Table[If[p =!= q, {p, q}, Nothing], {p, Join[wN, zN]}, {q, Join[wN, zN]}], 1]], #[[1]] =!= zN[[2]] && #[[1]] =!= zN[[3]] && #[[2]] =!= zN[[3]] &];\nvacId[ω_] := Select[vacCands, MatrixRank[{ω, Om1[zN, {#[[1]], #[[2]], 1}]}] == 1 &];\nextraTab = Table[{j + 1, rotRank[extras[[j]]], Table[rotRank[Ω1 + κ extras[[j]]], {κ, {2/3, -5/7, 11/4}}], vacId[extras[[j]]]}, {j, Length[extras]}];\n(* decomposition and the product locus *)\ndecA[M_] := Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[βbasis], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]];   (* r x 24 *)\nAcoef = decA /@ allMats;\ncs = Array[c, Length[allMats], 0];\nliveIdx = Select[Range[Length[allMats]], Union[Flatten[allMats[[#]]]] =!= {0} &];\naOfC = Sum[cs[[k]] Acoef[[k]], {k, liveIdx}];\nprodEqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[aOfC, 2]]], 0];\n{solTime, solProd} = AbsoluteTiming[TimeConstrained[Solve[prodEqs == 0, cs[[liveIdx]]], 180, $Failed]];\nchecks[\"product locus: # quadrics, # raw Solve components\"] = {Length[prodEqs], If[solProd === $Failed, $Failed, Length[solProd]]};\nGrid[{{\"joint site-2 span dim\", rB}, {\"extras: {index, rotRank, rotRank(Ω1+κω) at 3 κ, = Ω_(p,q)?}\", extraTab}, {\"live shapes (c-indices; c0 = identity)\", liveIdx - 1}, {\"# quadrics, Solve time (s), # raw Solve components\", {Length[prodEqs], N[solTime, 3], If[solProd === $Failed, $Failed, Length[solProd]]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
