      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
       "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.error"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3ec42168-9db9-4f61-a527-213ea374077a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the product points. Raw Solve components are redundant (overlapping parametrizations); classify each by its factors: site-1 factor f1 = column, site-2 factor f2 = row of Φ(c) (free parameters set to 1; c-entries of the dropped zero shapes reported as 0). A component is the localizing span if its site-2 factor is Ω1 (parallel), otherwise a nontrivial isolated point. *)\nω2 = βbasis[[2]];\nfactorsOf[sol_] := Module[{cc, free, M, rowi, colj}, cc = cs /. sol; free = Variables[cc]; cc = cc /. Thread[free -> 1];\n   M = Sum[cc[[k]] allMats[[k]], {k, Length[allMats]}];\n   If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {\"zero\"}, rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]];\n    {ReplacePart[cc, Thread[Complement[Range[Length[allMats]], liveIdx] -> 0]], M[[All, colj]]/M[[rowi, colj]], M[[rowi, All]]/M[[rowi, colj]], Variables[cs /. sol]}]];\nptAll = DeleteCases[factorsOf /@ solProd, {\"zero\"}];\nptLoc = Select[ptAll, MatrixRank[{#[[3]], Ω1}] == 1 &];\nptNon = DeleteDuplicates[Select[ptAll, MatrixRank[{#[[3]], Ω1}] > 1 &], MatrixRank[{#1[[2]], #2[[2]]}] == 1 && MatrixRank[{#1[[3]], #2[[3]]}] == 1 &];\nchecks[\"# components localizing (site-2 factor Ω1), # distinct nontrivial points\"] = {Length[ptLoc], Length[ptNon]};\nκΩ[f2_] := Module[{s = LinearSolve[Transpose[{Ω1, ω2}], f2]}, s[[2]]/s[[1]]];\nptNonTab = Table[{rotRank[p[[2]]], rotRank[p[[3]]], MatrixRank[{p[[3]], Ω1, ω2}], κΩ[p[[3]]], Length[p[[4]]]}, {p, ptNon}];\n(* normalize each point's c to its T(1,1) entry (index 3: 1, T10, T11, ...), then list; the c's of the nontrivial points *)\nptNonC = Table[With[{cp = p[[1]]}, cp/cp[[First[FirstPosition[cp, _?(# != 0 &)]]]]], {p, ptNon}];\nchecks[\"nontrivial points: {rotRank site1, rotRank site2, dim span{f2,Ω1,ω2}, κ, # free params}\"] = ptNonTab;\nchecks[\"localizing components: c(T10), c(T20), c(T30), c(T40) vanish?\"] = Union[ptLoc[[All, 1]][[All, {2, 4, 7, 11}]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"# raw components / localizing / distinct nontrivial points\", {Length[solProd], Length[ptLoc], Length[ptNon]}}, {\"opNames\", opNames}, {\"nontrivial: {rotRank s1, s2, dim span{f2,Ω1,ω2}, κ, #free}\", Column[ptNonTab]}}, {{\"c of nontrivial points (first nonzero entry = 1)\", Column[ptNonC]}}, {{\"c(T10),c(T20),c(T30),c(T40) on localizing components\", Union[ptLoc[[All, 1]][[All, {2, 4, 7, 11}]]]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
