      {
       "data": "Out[1121]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{\\# raw components / localizing / distinct nontrivial points} & \\left\\{55,53,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{c of the nontrivial point, normalized c(T20) = 1} & \\left\\{\\frac{81}{1075},\\frac{36}{215},\\frac{4}{39},1,\\frac{860}{1053},0,-\\frac{860}{729},-\\frac{92450}{85293},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{rotRank (site 1, site 2) of the point (4 = rotation)} & \\left\\{4,5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{c(T10), c(T20), c(T30) on the localizing components} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{site-2 factor in span\\{$\\Omega$1, $\\omega$2\\}; $\\kappa$} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},-\\frac{50717940}{541717}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
