  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* identify the factors of the three nontrivial points (w1 = 5/2 fixed; w3 drops out of rOm). Site 2 (rotRank 4): a torus-rotated vacuum f2 = s Ω_{(w1,y)} ρdiag[d1,d2,1]; the exact Solve gives its torus invariant y (compare with y_k = w2(θ12-h)/(θ12-kh), k = 1..5) and the torus d. Site 1: dressing span tests. Words(l) = all words of length <= l in E12, E13, E23; the covectors e1.X with X a word (acting from the right on e1) span the l-th dressing space; with R = Rrot(z,(w1,y_k,w3)) and D = ρdiag[resolvent]: the minimal l with f1 in span{e1.X.R.D : |X| <= l} is the dressing order (expected λ1-k+1: 1, 2, 3 for k = 4, 3, 2). *)\nsolveVac2[g_, w1v_] := Module[{s}, s = Select[Quiet[Solve[Thread[(Om1[zN, {w1v, yv, 1}] . ρdiag[{d1v, d2v, 1}]) == sv g], {yv, d1v, d2v, sv}]], (sv /. #) =!= 0 &]; If[s === {}, \"none\", {yv, d1v, d2v} /. s]];\nyTabF[ww_] := Table[ww[[2]] (θ12 - hN)/(θ12 - k hN), {k, 1, 5}];\nwords[l_] := Flatten[Table[Tuples[{Ee[1, 2], Ee[1, 3], Ee[2, 3]}, m], {m, 0, l}], 1];\nwordVecs[l_, R_, D_] := wordVecs[l, R, D] = DeleteDuplicates[Table[Normal[e1 . If[w === {}, id1, Dot @@ w] . R . D], {w, words[l]}], MatrixRank[{#1, #2}] == 1 &];\ndressOrder[f1_, R_, D_] := Module[{l = 0, res = None}, While[res === None && l <= 3, If[MatrixRank[Append[wordVecs[l, R, D], f1]] == MatrixRank[wordVecs[l, R, D]], res = l]; l++]; {res, If[res === None, None, MatrixRank[wordVecs[res, R, D]]], If[res === None || res == 0, None, MatrixRank[wordVecs[res - 1, R, D]]]}];\nu21kOf[y_, ww_] := Position[yTabF[ww], y][[All, 1]];\nu21id = Table[Module[{f1 = p[[2]], f2 = p[[3]], y2s, ks, yk, R, Dv, dres}, y2s = solveVac2[f2, wN[[1]]]; ks = If[ListQ[y2s], u21kOf[y2s[[1, 1]], wN], {}];\n   yk = If[ks === {}, None, yTabF[wN][[ks[[1]]]]];\n   dres = If[yk === None, None, R = Normal[Rrot[zN, {wN[[1]], yk, wN[[3]]}]]; Dv = <|\"Dy[w2]\" -> Dy[wN[[2]]], \"1\" -> {1, 1, 1}, \"Dy[y_k]\" -> Dy[yk]|>; Table[dn -> dressOrder[f1, R, ρdiag[Dv[dn]]], {dn, Keys[Dv]}]];\n   {y2s, ks, dres}], {p, ptNon}];\nchecks[\"u21 identification at P1, w2 = 7/3: {site-2 {y,d1,d2}, k, dressing orders per D}\"] = u21id;\nGrid[{{\"w2 = 7/3: y_k, k = 1..5\", yTabF[wN]}, {\"per nontrivial point: {site-2 {y, d1, d2}, k, dressing order {l, dim span(l), dim span(l-1)} per resolvent D}\", Column[u21id]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"94\" data-out-n=\"134\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[134]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:25.293em;vertical-align:-12.3765em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.9165em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.8765em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.8765em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:25.253em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-12.3765em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.8765em;\"><span style=\"top:-18.4739em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site 1: {y, d1, d2} of f1 = s Ω_(w1,y) </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\">(d)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-17.2639em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">y-star = w2(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">12-h)/(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">12-3h); Dy[w2]/Dy[w2][[3]]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.2437em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">w2(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">12-h)/(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">12-k h), k = 1..4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.2435em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site 1: f1 parallel to e1.R(w1,y-star).</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\">(Dy[w2])?</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.0435em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site 2: {y, d} Solve (rotation?)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.4335em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site 2: rank{u, X u, f2} for X = E12, E23, E13 (2 = f2 in the span) and rank of the 3-dim E23 span, per D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8335em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site 2 = e1.(1 + b E23).R(w1,y-star), D = 1: b = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05278em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.9765em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rotRank of e1-descendants</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist