hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-27.753em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.8765em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.3765em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
