      {
       "data": "Out[134]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{site 1: \\{y, d1, d2\\} of f1 = s $\\Omega$\\_(w1,y) $\\rho$(d)} & \\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{63}{43} & 2 & \\frac{20}{13}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{y-star = w2($\\theta$12-h)/($\\theta$12-3h); Dy[w2]/Dy[w2][[3]]} & \\left\\{-\\frac{63}{43},\\left\\{2,\\frac{20}{13},1\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{w2($\\theta$12-h)/($\\theta$12-k h), k = 1..4} & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\frac{7}{3}\\\\2 & -\\frac{63}{8}\\\\3 & -\\frac{63}{43}\\\\4 & -\\frac{21}{26}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{site 1: f1 parallel to e1.R(w1,y-star).$\\rho$(Dy[w2])?} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{site 2: \\{y, d\\} Solve (rotation?)} & \\text{none}\\\\\\hline\\text{site 2: rank\\{u, X u, f2\\} for X = E12, E23, E13 (2 = f2 in the span) and rank of the 3-dim E23 span, per D} & \\begin{matrix}\\left\\{\\text{1},\\left\\{\\text{E12}\\to 3,\\text{E23}\\to 2,\\text{E13}\\to 3\\right\\},3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\text{Dy[w1]},\\left\\{\\text{E12}\\to 3,\\text{E23}\\to 3,\\text{E13}\\to 3\\right\\},4\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\text{Dy[w2]},\\left\\{\\text{E12}\\to 3,\\text{E23}\\to 3,\\text{E13}\\to 3\\right\\},4\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\text{Dy[w3]},\\left\\{\\text{E12}\\to 3,\\text{E23}\\to 3,\\text{E13}\\to 3\\right\\},4\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\text{Dy[y-star]},\\left\\{\\text{E12}\\to 3,\\text{E23}\\to 3,\\text{E13}\\to … [latex truncated: 1678 chars total]",
