  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the pipeline for a fixed (h, θ, z) and arbitrary bra twist w = (w1, w2, w3): the T_λ(θ1-4h) do not depend on w (they use the ket twist diag z), so Tv0 of cell 5 is reused and only the covector Ω_w ⊗ Ω_w . T_λ, the exact product locus (shapes with vanishing <Ω|T dropped) and the factor identification are redone per w. For every nontrivial point (site-2 factor not Ω1) record f1, f2, the torus invariant y of the site-2 factor, its index k in y_k = w2(θ12-h)/(θ12-kh), rotRank, and the c-vector on (1, shapes). *)\nu21pipe[ww_] := Module[{Ω1x, Ω2x, mats, β, Ac, cv, idxs, eqs, sol, out},\n  Ω1x = Om1[zN, ww]; Ω2x = kron[Ω1x, Ω1x];\n  mats = Join[{Partition[Ω2x, d1]}, Table[Partition[Normal[Ω2x . Tv0[λ]], d1], {λ, shapes}]];\n  idxs = Select[Range[Length[mats]], Union[Flatten[mats[[#]]]] =!= {0} &];\n  β = Module[{b = {Ω1x}}, Do[If[MatrixRank[Append[b, row]] > Length[b], AppendTo[b, row/row[[Ordering[Abs[row], -1][[1]]]]]], {row, Flatten[mats[[idxs]], 1]}]; b];\n  Ac = Table[Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[β], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]], {M, mats[[idxs]]}];\n  cv = Array[cc, Length[idxs]]; eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[Sum[cv[[k]] Ac[[k]], {k, Length[idxs]}], 2]]], 0];\n  sol = DeleteDuplicates[Quiet[Solve[eqs == 0, cv]]];\n  out = Table[Module[{c1 = cv /. s, free, M, rowi, colj, f1, f2, y2, ks}, free = Variables[c1]; c1 = c1 /. Thread[free -> 1]; M = Sum[c1[[k]] mats[[idxs[[k]]]], {k, Length[idxs]}];\n     If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, Nothing, rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; f1 = M[[All, colj]]; f2 = M[[rowi, All]];\n      If[MatrixRank[{f2, Ω1x}] == 1, Nothing,\n       y2 = solveVac2[f2, ww[[1]]]; ks = If[ListQ[y2], u21kOf[y2[[1, 1]], ww], {}];\n       <|\"f1\" -> f1, \"f2\" -> f2, \"y2\" -> y2, \"k\" -> If[ks === {}, None, ks[[1]]], \"rotRank\" -> {rotRank[f1], rotRank[f2]}, \"c\" -> ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, Length[mats]], Thread[idxs -> c1]]|>]]], {s, sol}];\n  <|\"site-2 span dim\" -> Length[β], \"# solution components\" -> Length[sol], \"points\" -> out|>];\n{tP1, runP1} = AbsoluteTiming[u21pipe[wN]];\nu21pts1 = SortBy[runP1[\"points\"], #[\"k\"] &];\nchecks[\"u21 pipeline at P1: # nontrivial points, their k, rotRank\"] = {Length[u21pts1], #[\"k\"] & /@ u21pts1, #[\"rotRank\"] & /@ u21pts1};\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tP1}, {\"site-2 span dim, # Solve components\", {runP1[\"site-2 span dim\"], runP1[\"# solution components\"]}}, {\"# nontrivial points; k of each; rotRank (site 1, site 2)\", checks[\"u21 pipeline at P1: # nontrivial points, their k, rotRank\"]}, {\"c on (1, shapes) per point, normalized to the first nonzero entry\", Column[Table[p[\"c\"]/p[\"c\"][[First[FirstPosition[p[\"c\"], _?(# != 0 &)]]]], {p, u21pts1}]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
