       "data": "Out[139]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 4.911396\\\\\\hline\\text{site-2 span dim, \\# Solve components, y-star} & \\left\\{2,55,-\\frac{63}{43}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# nontrivial points} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{y1 = \\{y, d1, d2\\} (site 1), y2 (site 2)} & \\left\\{\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{63}{43} & 2 & \\frac{20}{13}\\end{pmatrix},\\text{none}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{rotRank (site 1, site 2)} & \\left\\{4,5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{f1 = e1 R(w1,y-star) $\\rho$(Dy[w2]) exactly (parallel)?} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{f2 in span\\{e1 R, e1 X R\\}: coefficients for X = E12, E23, E13} & \\left\\{\\text{no},\\left\\{\\frac{10814375}{100352196},-\\frac{89375}{1170288}\\right\\},\\text{no}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{c on (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T22,T30,T31,T32,T33)} & \\left\\{\\frac{81}{1075},\\frac{36}{215},\\frac{4}{39},1,\\frac{860}{1053},0,-\\frac{860}{729},-\\frac{92450}{85293},0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "467276b1-1d15-43b5-9a21-1721aa66a5f2"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## §2. Undoing the rotation of site 2, per-weight ranks, HW determination (spec `site1-Qform/7-undo-site2-rotation-span.md` §1–§3, §8; globals `u21`)\n\nFor each product point k (k = 2, 3, 4: site-2 torus invariant $y_k=w_2(\\theta_{12}-h)/(\\theta_{12}-kh)$), site 2 is $s\\,e_1^T\\rho(n_k)$ with $n_k$ the Gauss element of `rOm[z,(w1,y_k,w3)]` (no torus factor) and site 1 is a dressed rotation $g\\,\\rho(n_k)\\rho(\\Delta_{w_2})$, $g\\in e_1^T\\,U(\\mathfrak n_+)$. Since $\\rho(n)\\otimes\\rho(n)$ fixes every HW ket, $\\langle f_1\\otimes f_2|HW\\rangle=s\\langle\\varphi\\otimes e_1^T|HW\\rangle$ with $\\varphi=f_1\\rho(n_k)^{-1}$. Per-weight ranks are over six $w_2$; the weight of $\\varphi$ that determines the HW state $\\nu$ is $\\nu-\\Lambda$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the point families at six values of w2 (w1 = 5/2, w3 = 3/5 as in P1; same (h, θ, z)): one u21pipe run per w2. u21pt[k][w2] = the nontrivial point with site-2 invariant y_k. *)\nu21w1 = 5/2; u21w3 = 3/5; u21w2s = {7/3, -8/9, 4/27, 3, -1/2, 11/7}; u21ks = {2, 3, 4};\nu21ystar[k_, w2c_] := w2c (θ12 - hN)/(θ12 - k hN);\n{u21t, u21runs} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[w2c -> u21pipe[{u21w1, w2c, u21w3}], {w2c, u21w2s}]]];\nu21pt = Association[Table[k -> Association[Table[w2c -> Select[u21runs[w2c][\"points\"], #[\"k\"] === k &][[1]], {w2c, u21w2s}]], {k, u21ks}]];\nchecks[\"u21 exactly three nontrivial points per w2, with k = 2, 3, 4\"] = Table[Sort[#[\"k\"] & /@ u21runs[w2c][\"points\"]] === u21ks, {w2c, u21w2s}];\nchecks[\"u21 y_k of the site-2 factor == w2(θ12-h)/(θ12-kh), torus d = 1 (w2 all)\"] = Table[And @@ Table[u21pt[k][w2c][\"y2\"] === {{u21ystar[k, w2c], 1, 1}}, {k, u21ks}], {w2c, u21w2s}];\nchecks[\"u21 rotRank (site 1, site 2) per k (all w2)\"] = Table[k -> Union[Table[u21pt[k][w2c][\"rotRank\"], {w2c, u21w2s}]], {k, u21ks}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"w2\", \"y_2\", \"y_3\", \"y_4\", \"site-2 y matches y_k\"}}, Table[{w2c, u21ystar[2, w2c], u21ystar[3, w2c], u21ystar[4, w2c], checks[\"u21 y_k of the site-2 factor == w2(θ12-h)/(θ12-kh), torus d = 1 (w2 all)\"][[i]]}, {i, Length[u21w2s]}] /. {w2c -> u21w2s[[i]]}, {{\"time (s)\", u21t, \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"3 points per w2\", And @@ checks[\"u21 exactly three nontrivial points per w2, with k = 2, 3, 4\"], \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"rotRank (s1,s2) per k\", checks[\"u21 rotRank (site 1, site 2) per k (all w2)\"], \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
