  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the undo. Site 2 is f2 = sc e1.ρ(n_k), n_k = N+ Gauss element of rOm[z,(w1,y_k,w3)] (same r_k as the adjoint: rep independent); site 1 is f1 = g.ρ(n_k).ρ(Δ), Δ = diag(1/(w2-z)), g in e1.U(n+). Since ρ(n)⊗ρ(n) fixes every HW ket, <f1 x f2|HW> = sc <φ x e1|HW> with φ = f1.ρ(n_k)^-1 (undone covector at site 1). HW kets = joint null space of the total raising generators per weight sector (first find which E_ij annihilate the ket e1 in this convention). Rho(n) is taken as Normal[Rrot[...]] (nexp of the three exponentials). *)\nu21rho[k_, w2c_] := u21rho[k, w2c] = Normal[Rrot[zN, {u21w1, u21ystar[k, w2c], u21w3}]];\nu21f1 = Association[Table[k -> Association[Table[w2c -> Normal[u21pt[k][w2c][\"f1\"]], {w2c, u21w2s}]], {k, u21ks}]];\nu21f2 = Association[Table[k -> Association[Table[w2c -> Normal[u21pt[k][w2c][\"f2\"]], {w2c, u21w2s}]], {k, u21ks}]];\nu21sc[k_, w2c_] := u21f2[k][w2c][[1]]/(e1 . u21rho[k, w2c])[[1]];\nu21phi[k_, w2c_] := u21f1[k][w2c] . Inverse[u21rho[k, w2c]];\nchecks[\"u21 f2 parallel to e1.ρ(n_k) exactly, all k, w2\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[u21f2[k][w2c] == u21sc[k, w2c] Normal[e1 . u21rho[k, w2c]], {k, u21ks}, {w2c, u21w2s}]];\nchecks[\"u21 y_k never a z_i or w2 (Dy finite)\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[FreeQ[zN, u21ystar[k, w2c]] && u21ystar[k, w2c] =!= w2c, {k, u21ks}, {w2c, u21w2s}]];\nu21ketAnn = {Norm[Normal[Ee[1, 2] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[2, 1] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[2, 3] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[3, 2] . e1]]};\nu21raise = If[u21ketAnn[[1]] == 0 && u21ketAnn[[3]] == 0, {{1, 2}, {2, 3}}, {{2, 1}, {3, 2}}];\nu21Etot = Normal[(E1 @@ # + E2 @@ #)] & /@ u21raise;\nu21sectors = Union[wtBasis];\n{u21tHW, u21HWlist} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[Module[{idx = secOf[μ], A, ns}, A = Join @@ (#[[All, idx]] & /@ u21Etot); ns = NullSpace[A]; Table[<|\"wt\" -> μ, \"vec\" -> ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, d2], Thread[idx -> n]]|>, {n, ns}]], {μ, u21sectors}], 1]];\nu21HW = Transpose[u21HWlist[[All, \"vec\"]]]; u21HWwt = u21HWlist[[All, \"wt\"]];\nu21Tally = Tally[u21HWwt];\nchecks[\"u21 HW weights/multiplicities (expect [4,1,0]^2 = 15 states)\"] = u21Tally;\nchecks[\"u21 number of HW kets\"] = Length[u21HWlist];\nchecks[\"u21 HW kets killed by total raising\"] = And @@ Table[Norm[Flatten[Normal[(E1 @@ r + E2 @@ r) . u21HW]]] == 0, {r, u21raise}];\nchecks[\"u21 (ρ(n_k) x ρ(n_k)).HW == HW (k, two w2)\"] = Table[With[{R = u21rho[k, w2c]}, KroneckerProduct[R, R] . u21HW == u21HW], {k, u21ks}, {w2c, {7/3, -1/2}}];\nchecks[\"u21 <f1 x f2|HW> == sc <φ x e1|HW> (all k, w2, HW)\"] = Table[kron[u21f1[k][w2c], u21f2[k][w2c]] . u21HW == u21sc[k, w2c] kron[u21phi[k, w2c], e1] . u21HW, {k, u21ks}, {w2c, u21w2s}];\nGrid[{{\"ket e1 annihilated by (E12, E21, E23, E32 norms)\", u21ketAnn}, {\"raising pairs used\", u21raise}, {\"HW time (s), # HW kets\", {u21tHW, Length[u21HWlist]}}, {\"HW weights {wt, mult}\", Column[u21Tally]}, {\"f2 ∥ e1.ρ(n_k); y_k finite\", {checks[\"u21 f2 parallel to e1.ρ(n_k) exactly, all k, w2\"], checks[\"u21 y_k never a z_i or w2 (Dy finite)\"]}}, {\"HW killed by total raising\", checks[\"u21 HW kets killed by total raising\"]}, {\"(ρ(n)⊗ρ(n)).HW == HW\", checks[\"u21 (ρ(n_k) x ρ(n_k)).HW == HW (k, two w2)\"]}, {\"<f1⊗f2|HW> == sc <φ⊗e1|HW>\", checks[\"u21 <f1 x f2|HW> == sc <φ x e1|HW> (all k, w2, HW)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
