  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* torus completion, step 1: draw 18 random (w2, D) pairs (14 HW kets need at least 14 rows per point) and run the pipeline at the random w2 (about 5 s each). The torus acts on the pair of covectors as ρ(D) on both sites, which multiplies every HW overlap by the character Π D_i^ν_i. *)\nSeedRandom[2121]; u21nR = 18; u21rndW2 = {}; While[Length[u21rndW2] < u21nR, With[{c0 = RandomInteger[{-9, 9}]/RandomInteger[{2, 9}]}, If[! MemberQ[Join[zN, {0, u21w1, u21w3, 31/35, thN, hN}, u21rndW2, u21w2s], c0] && And @@ Table[FreeQ[zN, u21ystar[k, c0]] && u21ystar[k, c0] =!= c0, {k, u21ks}], AppendTo[u21rndW2, c0]]]];\nu21rndD = Table[RandomSample[Select[Range[-9, 9], # != 0 &], 3]/RandomSample[Range[2, 9], 3], {u21nR}];\n{u21tR, u21rndRuns} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[c0 -> u21pipe[{u21w1, c0, u21w3}], {c0, u21rndW2}]]];\nu21rndPt = Association[Table[k -> Association[Table[c0 -> Select[u21rndRuns[c0][\"points\"], #[\"k\"] === k &], {c0, u21rndW2}]], {k, u21ks}]];\nchecks[\"u21 torus: exactly one point per k for all random w2\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Length[u21rndPt[k][c0]] == 1, {k, u21ks}, {c0, u21rndW2}]];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", u21tR}, {\"random w2\", u21rndW2}, {\"one point per k at every random w2\", checks[\"u21 torus: exactly one point per k for all random w2\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
