       "data": "Out[202]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 29.033383\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# nontrivial points per w2} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{5}{8} & 1\\\\1 & 1\\\\-\\frac{3}{2} & 1\\\\-\\frac{2}{5} & 1\\\\-\\frac{4}{5} & 1\\\\-\\frac{1}{3} & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
