  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* torus completion, step 2: rows <f1 ρ(D) x f2 ρ(D)|HW_nu> with the ACTUAL pipeline covectors at the 18 random (w2, D); HW rank (of 14), per-irrep ranks, for each k and the unions over k. Also the fixed-torus (D = 1) rank with the 18 random w2. *)\nu21torusRow[k_, i_] := With[{p = u21rndPt[k][u21rndW2[[i]]][[1]], rD = ρdiag[u21rndD[[i]]]}, kron[Normal[p[\"f1\"]] . rD, Normal[p[\"f2\"]] . rD] . u21HW];\nu21MT = Association[Table[k -> Table[u21torusRow[k, i], {i, u21nR}], {k, u21ks}]];\nu21MT[{2, 3, 4}] = Join @@ (u21MT /@ u21ks); u21MT[{2, 3}] = Join @@ (u21MT /@ {2, 3});\nu21hwTor = Association[Table[v -> {MatrixRank[u21MT[v]], u21perIrrep[u21MT[v]]}, {v, {2, 3, 4, {2, 3}, {2, 3, 4}}}]];\nu21fixR = Association[Table[k -> MatrixRank[Table[kron[Normal[u21rndPt[k][c0][[1]][\"f1\"]], Normal[u21rndPt[k][c0][[1]][\"f2\"]]] . u21HW, {c0, u21rndW2}]], {k, u21ks}]];\nchecks[\"u21 HW rank torus-completed (18 random (w2,D)) per k, {2,3}, {2,3,4} (of 14)\"] = (u21hwTor[#][[1]] & /@ {2, 3, 4, {2, 3}, {2, 3, 4}});\nchecks[\"u21 HW rank fixed torus D = 1, 18 random w2, per k\"] = Values[u21fixR];\nchecks[\"u21 per-irrep torus-completed rank, k = 4: {irrep, mult, rank}\"] = u21hwTor[4][[2, All, 1 ;; 3]];\nchecks[\"u21 per-irrep torus-completed rank, k = 2: {irrep, mult, rank}\"] = u21hwTor[2][[2, All, 1 ;; 3]];\nchecks[\"u21 per-irrep torus-completed rank, k = 3: {irrep, mult, rank}\"] = u21hwTor[3][[2, All, 1 ;; 3]];\nGrid[{{\"HW rank torus-completed: k=2, 3, 4, {2,3}, {2,3,4} (of 14)\", checks[\"u21 HW rank torus-completed (18 random (w2,D)) per k, {2,3}, {2,3,4} (of 14)\"]}, {\"HW rank fixed torus D = 1, 18 random w2: k = 2, 3, 4\", checks[\"u21 HW rank fixed torus D = 1, 18 random w2, per k\"]}, {\"per irrep {irrep, mult, rank}, k = 2\", Column[checks[\"u21 per-irrep torus-completed rank, k = 2: {irrep, mult, rank}\"]]}, {\"k = 3\", Column[checks[\"u21 per-irrep torus-completed rank, k = 3: {irrep, mult, rank}\"]]}, {\"k = 4\", Column[checks[\"u21 per-irrep torus-completed rank, k = 4: {irrep, mult, rank}\"]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
