  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "## §3. Q-side for [4,1,0] (hypotheses to verify; globals `u21`, plus the generic names of the [3,1,0] Q-side cells 16-18: `uQ`, `xQ`, `uPts`, `precQ`, `tZp`, `stQ`, `vecSt`, `muSt`, `nSt`, `valsSt`, `opDir`, `opDual`, `solveQ`, `qdS`, `quS`, `QU`, `QD`, `qdVac`, `det6`, `psiQg`, `minor1`)\n\nHypotheses (from the task): vacuum SoV triple $(\\theta-5h,\\theta-4h,\\theta-h)$, i.e. $\\Psi_Q=\\prod_s[Q^2(\\theta_s-4h)Q^3(\\theta_s-5h)-Q^3(\\theta_s-4h)Q^2(\\theta_s-5h)]\\,Q^3(\\theta_s-h)$; minor $M=W(4,5)$; $\\deg q^j=\\mu_j$, $\\deg q_i=8-\\mu_i$; $\\det_6$ with poles $n=0..4$ on both ladders (10 poles), insertions $1$ and $e^{2\\pi ix/h}$. All are scanned/verified below, not assumed.",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"102\" data-out-n=\"228\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"16\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[228]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.4808em;vertical-align:-3.4704em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.0104em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.9704em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.9704em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.4408em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.4704em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9704em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.1304em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3x3: (b”-a”c”)/(a”c”) - (w2-y-star)/(y-star-z2): rational z, symbolic Y, W, w1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9304em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">same, symbolic z</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7304em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b” - a” c” with W -&gt; Y (control)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4981em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b”/(a”c”)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.2496em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">beta/alpha fit (deg 1)/(deg 2) through 18 points</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.1104em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">beta/alpha = (6125/5676) w2/((w2-z3)(y-star-z3)), all 18 points?</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.4704em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.4408em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.4704em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9704em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.1304em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9304em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7304em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4981em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.