   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Q-side, port of cell 16 of L2-310-two-rotations.wb (rep-generic; Λ, nuP, tL2, Zd from cells 2-3). Polynomial t_a(u) (degree 2a) by exact Lagrange interpolation on 7 points; eigenstates of t1 + π t2 at u = 3/7 per weight sector at 60 digits; eigenvalue polynomials from the 7 point values (largest component); then minimal-degree monic q's of the direct and dual Baxter equations; degree cap raised from 8 to 12 (deg q_i = 8 - μ_i for [4,1,0]) *)\nprecQ = 60; uPts = 1/7 + Range[0, 6]/3;\n(* size of a 60-digit residual: a numerically exact zero is reported by its accuracy bound 10^-Accuracy *)\nsizeQ[x_] := If[x == 0, 10.^-Accuracy[x], N[Abs[x], 3]];\nlagQ[k_] := Product[(uQ - uPts[[l]])/(uPts[[k]] - uPts[[l]]), {l, DeleteCases[Range[7], k]}];\n{tpTime, tZp} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Sum[lagQ[m] tL2[a, uPts[[m]], Zd], {m, 7}], {a, 3}]];\nchecks[\"Q1: qdet t3(u) = χ3 ν1(u)ν2(u-h)ν3(u-2h) (symbolic, exact)\"] = SubsetQ[{0}, Union[Expand[(tZp[[3]] - χ3z nuP[1][uQ] nuP[2][uQ - hN] nuP[3][uQ - 2 hN] id2)[\"NonzeroValues\"]]]];\nchecks[\"Q1: degrees of t_a(u) in u\"] = Table[Max[Exponent[Expand[tZp[[a]][\"NonzeroValues\"]], uQ]], {a, 3}];\nmixQ = N[tL2[1, 3/7, Zd] + Pi tL2[2, 3/7, Zd], precQ];\nsectQ = GatherBy[Range[d2], wtBasis[[#]] &];\n{eigTime, stQ} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[With[{es = Eigensystem[Normal[mixQ[[sec, sec]]]]}, Table[<|\"mu\" -> wtBasis[[sec[[1]]]], \"gap\" -> If[Length[sec] > 1, Min[Abs[Delete[es[[1]], r] - es[[1, r]]]], Infinity], \"vec\" -> Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, r]]], {d2}]]|>, {r, Length[sec]}]], {sec, sectQ}], 1]];\nvecSt = stQ[[All, \"vec\"]]; muSt = stQ[[All, \"mu\"]]; nSt = Length[stQ];\ntNum[a_, x_] := tNum[a, x] = N[tL2[a, x, Zd], precQ];\n{valTime, valsSt} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[Expand[Sum[lagQ[m] (tNum[a, uPts[[m]]] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]], {m, 7}]], {a, 3}]], {ψ, vecSt}]];\nchecks[\"Q1: eigen-residual max |t_a(x)ψ - t_a^B(x)ψ| (x = nodes and 9/11)\"] = sizeQ[Max[Table[Max[Abs[tNum[a, x] . vecSt[[A]] - (valsSt[[A, a]] /. uQ -> x) vecSt[[A]]]], {A, nSt}, {a, 3}, {x, Append[uPts, 9/11]}]]];\nchecks[\"Q1: simple spectrum, min eigenvalue gap of t1+πt2 within a sector\"] = N[Min[stQ[[All, \"gap\"]]], 3];\nopDir[tt_, Q_, x_] := nuP[1][x] nuP[1][x + hN] nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x - hN] - (tt[[1]] /. uQ -> x) nuP[1][x + hN] nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. uQ -> x + hN) nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x + hN] - (tt[[3]] /. uQ -> x + 2 hN) Q[x + 2 hN];\nopDual[tt_, Q_, x_] := nuP[3][x] nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x + hN] - (tt[[1]] /. uQ -> x) nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. uQ -> x) nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x - hN] - (tt[[3]] /. uQ -> x) Q[x - 2 hN];\n(* minimal-degree monic q with Q = zz^(s x/h) q solving op; {} if none up to degree 12 *)\nsolveQ[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{cq, eqs, ns, res = {}}, Do[If[res === {}, eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[op[tt, Function[yy, zz^(s (yy - xQ)/hN) Sum[cq[j] yy^j, {j, 0, d}]], xQ]], 10^-40], xQ]; ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, cq[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], precQ], Tolerance -> 10^-30]]; If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, xQ, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] xQ^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 12}]; res];\nqResid[op_, tt_, zz_, s_, q_] := Max[Abs[CoefficientList[Expand[op[tt, Function[yy, zz^(s (yy - xQ)/hN) (q /. xQ -> yy)], xQ]], xQ]]];\n{q1Time, q1Deg} = AbsoluteTiming[{Exponent[Table[solveQ[opDir, valsSt[[1]], zN[[i]], -1], {i, 3}], xQ], Exponent[Table[solveQ[opDual, valsSt[[1]], zN[[j]], 1], {j, 3}], xQ]}];\n{qTime, {qdS, quS}} = AbsoluteTiming[{Table[solveQ[opDir, valsSt[[A]], zN[[i]], -1], {A, nSt}, {i, 3}], Table[solveQ[opDual, valsSt[[A]], zN[[j]], 1], {A, nSt}, {j, 3}]}];\nnotFound = Select[Range[nSt], ! FreeQ[{qdS[[#]], quS[[#]]}, {}] &];\nchecks[\"Q1: # states with all six Q's found\"] = nSt - Length[notFound];\nchecks[\"Q1: deg q^j = μ_j for all states\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Exponent[quS[[A, j]], xQ] == muSt[[A, j]], {A, nSt}, {j, 3}]];\nchecks[\"Q1: deg q_i = 8 - μ_i for all states\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Exponent[qdS[[A, i]], xQ] == 8 - muSt[[A, i]], {A, nSt}, {i, 3}]];\nchecks[\"Q1: max Baxter residual (coefficients, monic q)\"] = sizeQ[Max[Table[{qResid[opDir, valsSt[[A]], zN[[i]], -1, qdS[[A, i]]], qResid[opDual, valsSt[[A]], zN[[i]], 1, quS[[A, i]]]}, {A, nSt}, {i, 3}]]];\nGrid[{{\"t_a(u) interpolation time (s)\", tpTime}, {\"qdet symbolic exact\", checks[\"Q1: qdet t3(u) = χ3 ν1(u)ν2(u-h)ν3(u-2h) (symbolic, exact)\"]}, {\"deg_u t_a\", checks[\"Q1: degrees of t_a(u) in u\"]}, {\"# states, eigensystem time (s), eigenvalue-polynomial time (s)\", {nSt, eigTime, valTime}}, {\"eigen-residual (60 digits)\", checks[\"Q1: eigen-residual max |t_a(x)ψ - t_a^B(x)ψ| (x = nodes and 9/11)\"]}, {\"min sector gap (simple spectrum)\", checks[\"Q1: simple spectrum, min eigenvalue gap of t1+πt2 within a sector\"]}, {\"state 1 (μ = \" <> ToString[muSt[[1]]] <> \"): deg q_i, deg q^j; time (s)\", {q1Deg, q1Time}}, {\"all states: Q time (s)\", qTime}, {\"# states with all six Q's\", checks[\"Q1: # states with all six Q's found\"]}, {\"deg q^j = μ_j / deg q_i = 8 - μ_i\", {checks[\"Q1: deg q^j = μ_j for all states\"], checks[\"Q1: deg q_i = 8 - μ_i for all states\"]}}, {\"max Baxter residual\", checks[\"Q1: max Baxter residual (coefficients, monic q)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"175\" data-out-n=\"1124\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"33\" data-sub-start=\"3\" data-sub-end=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1124]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:14.44em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:14.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t_a(u) interpolation time (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qdet symbolic exact</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg_u t_a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># states, eigensystem time (s), eigenvalue-polynomial time (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eigen-residual (60 digits)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min sector gap (simple spectrum)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state 1 (</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"> = {6, 4, 0}): deg q_i, deg q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">j; time (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">all 225 states: Q time (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># states with all six Q’s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.94em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">j = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_j / deg q_i = 6 - </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:3.14em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max Baxter residual</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:14.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.737742</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-rig