  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* which reference triple (n1, n21, n22) in Psi_Q = prod_s [Q2(th_s - n21 h) Q3(th_s - n1 h) - Q3(th_s - n21 h) Q2(th_s - n1 h)] Q3(th_s - n22 h) makes <Omega|psi>/<x0|psi> proportional to det6[B, vac]/Psi_Q over all states? Candidates from the task (5,4,1), (5,4,2), (5,4,3), (5,3,1), (4,3,1) plus a systematic scan of every triple with 6 >= n1 > n21 >= 0 and n22 in 0..5 (max |ratio/ratio1 - 1| and min |Psi_Q| to exclude vanishing denominators) *)\nu21triples = Join[{{5, 4, 1}, {5, 4, 2}, {5, 4, 3}, {5, 3, 1}, {4, 3, 1}}, Complement[Flatten[Table[{n1, n21, n22}, {n1, 1, 6}, {n21, 0, n1 - 1}, {n22, 0, 5}], 2], {{5, 4, 1}, {5, 4, 2}, {5, 4, 3}, {5, 3, 1}, {4, 3, 1}}]];\nu21triDevOf[tr_] := Module[{psi = Table[psiQg[B, tr], {B, nSt}], rt}, If[Min[Abs[psi]] < 10^-30, {tr, \"Psi has a zero\", \"\"}, rt = Table[(ovl[[B]]/x0ovl[[B]])/(det6List[[B]]/psi[[B]]), {B, nSt}]; {tr, sizeQ[constDev[rt]], N[Min[Abs[psi]], 3]}]];\n{u21tTri, u21triDev} = AbsoluteTiming[u21triDevOf /@ u21triples];\nu21triBest = Take[SortBy[Select[u21triDev, NumberQ[#[[2]]] &], #[[2]] &], 6];\nchecks[\"u21 vacuum triple scan: the five task candidates {triple, max |ratio/ratio1-1|, min |PsiQ|}\"] = u21triDev[[1 ;; 5]];\nchecks[\"u21 vacuum triple scan: best six over all scanned triples\"] = u21triBest;\nGrid[Join[{{\"triple (n1,n21,n22): points th - n h\", \"max |ratio/ratio[1] - 1| over all states\", \"min |Psi_Q|\"}}, u21triDev[[1 ;; 5]], {{\"best six overall\", \"\", \"\"}}, u21triBest, {{\"time (s)\", u21tTri, \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
