  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* T_lambda(th1-4h) eigenvalues on the 576 states and the 14-function basis. <Omega|T44 = 0 as a covector, so (with <Omega|psi> != 0 on all states) tau_44 must vanish identically on the eigenstates; basis (1, tau_lambda for the 13 other shapes). Ladder-1 det2 power coefficients over a pole subset P (numerator, not yet divided by a minor): coefficient of y^p = sum_{n+m=p} w_n w_m [Q2(x_n) Q3(x_m - h) - Q3(x_n) Q2(x_m - h)], x_n = th1 - n h, w_n = 1/prod_{m'!=n}(m'-n)h; this is det{{-<Q^j E>, <Q^j[-] E>}}_{j=3,2} with E(x_n) = y^n. Minor scan: W(a,b) = Q2(th1 - a h) Q3(th1 - b h) - Q3(th1 - a h) Q2(th1 - b h) for all 0 <= a < b <= 6; residual = max over y-powers of the relative least-squares misfit of (y^p coefficient)/W to span{1, tau}. *)\nu21shp = Complement[shapes, {{4, 4}}];\nTv0N = Association[Table[λ -> N[Tv0[λ], precQ], {λ, shapes}]];\nτSt = Association[Table[λ -> Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[vecSt[[B]]], -1][[1]]}, (Tv0N[λ] . vecSt[[B]])[[k]]/vecSt[[B, k]]], {B, nSt}], {λ, shapes}]];\nchecks[\"u21: T_lambda(th1-4h) eigen-residual on all states\"] = sizeQ[Max[Table[Max[Abs[Tv0N[λ] . vecSt[[B]] - τSt[λ][[B]] vecSt[[B]]]], {λ, shapes}, {B, nSt}]]];\nchecks[\"u21: max |tau_44| over states (should be ~0)\"] = sizeQ[Max[Abs[τSt[{4, 4}]]]];\nbasisT = Transpose[Join[{ConstantArray[1, nSt]}, Table[τSt[λ], {λ, u21shp}]]];\nnrmQ[v_] := Sqrt[Total[Abs[Flatten[v]]^2]];\nspanRes[f_, A_] := Module[{cf = LeastSquares[A, f]}, nrmQ[A . cf - f]/nrmQ[f]];\nchecks[\"u21: basis (1, 13 tau): # sv, min/max sv\"] = With[{sv = SingularValueList[basisT, Tolerance -> 0]}, N[{Length[sv], Last[sv]/First[sv]}, 3]];\nth1 = thN[[1]];\nu21wg[P_, n_] := N[1/Product[(m - n) hN, {m, DeleteCases[P, n]}], precQ];\nu21numCoefs[P_] := Table[Table[Sum[If[MemberQ[P, p - n], u21wg[P, n] u21wg[P, p - n] (QU[B, 2, th1 - n hN] QU[B, 3, th1 - (p - n) hN - hN] - QU[B, 3, th1 - n hN] QU[B, 2, th1 - (p - n) hN - hN]), 0], {n, P}], {B, nSt}], {p, 0, 2 Max[P]}];\nu21W[B_, {a_, b_}] := QU[B, 2, th1 - a hN] QU[B, 3, th1 - b hN] - QU[B, 3, th1 - a hN] QU[B, 2, th1 - b hN];\nu21num01234 = u21numCoefs[{0, 1, 2, 3, 4}];\nu21minorRes[mp_] := Module[{den = Table[u21W[B, mp], {B, nSt}], cof}, If[Min[Abs[den]] < 10^-30, Return[\"W has a zero\"]]; cof = u21num01234/Table[den, {Length[u21num01234]}]; sizeQ[Max[Table[If[nrmQ[cof[[p]]] < 10^-40, 0, spanRes[cof[[p]], basisT]], {p, Length[cof]}]]]];\nu21pairs = Select[Tuples[Range[0, 6], 2], #[[1]] < #[[2]] &];\n{u21tm, u21minRes} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[mp -> u21minorRes[mp], {mp, u21pairs}]]];\nu21taskPairs = {{4, 5}, {3, 4}, {3, 5}, {4, 6}};\nchecks[\"u21: minor candidates (a,b): span residual of det2^{0..4}[y]/W, symbolic y\"] = Table[{mp, u21minRes[mp]}, {mp, u21taskPairs}];\nu21bestMin = Take[SortBy[Select[Normal[u21minRes], NumberQ[#[[2]]] &], #[[2]] &], 4];\nGrid[Join[{{\"item\", \"value\"}, {\"eigen-residual of T on states\", checks[\"u21: T_lambda(th1-4h) eigen-residual on all states\"]}, {\"max |tau44|\", checks[\"u21: max |tau_44| over states (should be ~0)\"]}, {\"basis: # sv, min/max\", checks[\"u21: basis (1, 13 tau): # sv, min/max sv\"]}}, {{\"minor W(a,b)\", \"max span residual\"}}, Table[{mp, N[u21minRes[mp], 3]}, {mp, u21taskPairs}], {{\"best 4 among all pairs 0<=a<b<=6\", N[u21bestMin, 3]}, {\"time (s)\", u21tm}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
