   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* pole-subset scan for [4,1,0] with the minor selected by the scan of the previous cell (u21Mpair). Per subset P (|P| >= 2, subsets of {0..4}): (1) fit of every y-power coefficient of det2^(P)/M to the 14-function basis (1, tau of the 13 live shapes); (2) exact rational curve cyx(y); (3) exact y with cyx(y) parallel to each of the three product points c_k (k = 2,3,4; 14 live entries); (4) rank of Phi(c(y)) at three generic y; (5) all y with Phi(c(y)) of rank <= 1 (gcd of the 2x2 minors of the 2 x 24 decomposition Acoef), each nonzero root classified: Phi != 0, localizing (site-2 factor parallel to Omega1) or not, parallel to which c_k? *)\nu21Mpair = If[u21bestMin[[1, 2]] < 10^-30, u21bestMin[[1, 1]], {4, 5}];\nu21subsets = Select[Subsets[Range[0, 4]], Length[#] >= 2 &];\nu21slot = Range[14];   (* allMats slots of (1, shapes except (4,4)); the (4,4) slot is identically zero *)\nu21cK = Association[Table[k -> u21pts1[[k - 1]][\"c\"][[u21slot]], {k, u21ks}]];\nchecks[\"u21: u21pts1 sorted by k (k = 2,3,4)\"] = (#[\"k\"] & /@ u21pts1) === u21ks;\nu21names = Join[{\"1\"}, (\"T\" <> ToString[#] &) /@ u21shp];\nu21gen = {2, -5/3, 7/5};\nu21Phi[cy_, yv_] := Sum[(cy[[i]] /. ySym -> yv) allMats[[u21slot[[i]]]], {i, Length[u21slot]}];\nminorM[B_] := u21W[B, u21Mpair];\nu21analyze[P_] := Module[{co, dg, cp, resP, rat, cyx, par, supp, ranks, aOf, mins, g, rts, rootInfo, den = Table[minorM[B], {B, nSt}]},\n  co = Table[v/den, {v, u21numCoefs[P]}]; dg = Length[co] - 1;\n  cp = Table[If[nrmQ[co[[p + 1]]] < 10^-40, ConstantArray[0, Length[u21slot]], LeastSquares[basisT, co[[p + 1]]]], {p, 0, dg}];\n  resP = Table[If[nrmQ[co[[p + 1]]] < 10^-40, 0, nrmQ[basisT . cp[[p + 1]] - co[[p + 1]]]/nrmQ[co[[p + 1]]]], {p, 0, dg}];\n  If[sizeQ[Max[resP]] >= 10^-30, Return[<|\"P\" -> P, \"inSpan\" -> False, \"res\" -> sizeQ[Max[resP]]|>]];\n  rat = Rationalize[Chop[cp, 10^-40], 10^-30]; cyx = Factor /@ (ySym^Range[0, dg] . rat);\n  supp = Pick[u21names, Unitize[cyx /. ySym -> 3], 1];\n  par = Table[k -> With[{s = Solve[Join[Thread[Flatten[Minors[{cyx, u21cK[k]}, 2]] == 0], {ySym != 0}], ySym]}, If[s === {}, \"none\", ySym /. s]], {k, u21ks}];\n  ranks = Table[MatrixRank[u21Phi[cyx, yv]], {yv, u21gen}];\n  aOf = Sum[cyx[[i]] Acoef[[u21slot[[i]]]], {i, Length[u21slot]}];\n  mins = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Expand[Minors[aOf, 2]]]], 0];\n  g = If[mins === {}, 0, PolynomialGCD @@ mins];\n  rts = If[g === 0, \"all y\", If[Exponent[g, ySym] == 0, {}, ySym /. Solve[g == 0, ySym]]];\n  rootInfo = If[rts === \"all y\", {}, Table[If[yr == 0, {yr, \"y=0\"}, With[{M = u21Phi[cyx, yr], cv = cyx /. ySym -> yr}, If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {yr, \"Phi=0\"}, With[{ri = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]}, {yr, MatrixRank[M], If[MatrixRank[{M[[ri]], Ω1}] == 1, \"localizing\", \"non-local\"], Select[u21ks, MatrixRank[{cv, u21cK[#]}] == 1 &]}]]]], {yr, rts}]];\n  <|\"P\" -> P, \"inSpan\" -> True, \"res\" -> sizeQ[Max[resP]], \"ratErr\" -> sizeQ[Max[Abs[cp - rat]]], \"cyx\" -> cyx, \"support\" -> supp, \"yDegs\" -> MinMax[Select[Range[0, dg], nrmQ[co[[# + 1]]] > 10^-40 &]], \"yCK\" -> par, \"genRanks\" -> ranks, \"rank1roots\" -> rts, \"rootInfo\" -> rootInfo|>];\n{u21tScan, u21res} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[P -> TimeConstrained[u21analyze[P], 180, \"timeout\"], {P, u21subsets}]]];\nchecks[\"u21: pole-subset scan [4,1,0] done (time s)\"] = u21tScan;\nu21hit = Table[P -> If[u21res[P] === \"timeout\" || ! u21res[P][\"inSpan\"], \"n/a\", Select[u21res[P][\"yCK\"], #[[2]] =!= \"none\" &]], {P, u21subsets}];\nchecks[\"u21: pole sets whose curve hits a product point c_k: {P -> {k -> y}}\"] = Select[u21hit, # [[2]] =!= \"n/a\" && #[[2]] =!= {} &];\nGrid[Join[{{\"P\", \"in span? (res)\", \"support\", \"y-degrees\", \"y hitting c_k (k = 2,3,4)\", \"rank Phi at y=2,-5/3,7/5\", \"nonzero y with Phi rank<=1 {y, rank, local?, which c_k}\"}}, Table[With[{r = u21res[P]}, If[r === \"timeout\", {P, \"timeout\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, If[r[\"inSpan\"], {P, N[r[\"res\"], 2], r[\"support\"], r[\"yDegs\"], r[\"yCK\"], r[\"genRanks\"], If[r[\"rank1roots\"] === \"all y\", \"all y (localizing span)\", DeleteCases[r[\"rootInfo\"], {_, \"y=0\"} | {_, \"Phi=0\"}]]}, {P, {False, N[r[\"res\"], 2]}, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}]]], {P, u21subsets}], {{\"time (s)\", u21tScan, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
