     "id": "1c04f2b0-6666-4f9d-b77a-6065a406e64b"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* end-to-end for each product point k = 2, 3, 4: Phi_k = sum_i c_k[i] <Omega|O_i (O = 1, T_lambda(th1-4h)), a product covector (rank 1 as a 24x24 matrix, exact). Claim: <Phi_k|psi>/<x0|psi> proportional to det6[B, vac(w1,w2)]/Psi_Q x det2^{(0..k)}[y_k]/M over the 576 states (M = W(u21Mpair), triple u21tri from the scan), y_k = w2(th12-h)/(th12-kh). Controls: wrong y (-63/7, 2), wrong pole set P_j with y_k, other triples. The det2 vector over all states is computed once per call (u21fy returns the full list). *)\nu21tri = If[u21triBest[[1, 2]] < 10^-30, u21triBest[[1, 1]], {5, 4, 1}];\nu21PhiP = Association[Table[k -> Flatten[Sum[u21cK[k][[i]] allMats[[i]], {i, 14}]], {k, u21ks}]];\nchecks[\"u21: Phi_k product covector (rank of 24x24, exact), k = 2,3,4\"] = Table[MatrixRank[Partition[u21PhiP[k], d1]], {k, u21ks}];\nu21ovP = Association[Table[k -> Table[u21PhiP[k] . vecSt[[B]], {B, nSt}], {k, u21ks}]];\nu21numK = Association[Table[k -> u21numCoefs[Range[0, k]], {k, u21ks}]];\nu21minV = Table[minorM[B], {B, nSt}];\nu21fy[j_, yy_] := With[{ypow = N[yy, precQ]^Range[0, Length[u21numK[j]] - 1]}, (ypow . u21numK[j])/u21minV];\nu21psi[tr_] := u21psi[tr] = Table[psiQg[B, tr], {B, nSt}];\nu21e2e[k_, j_, yy_, tr_] := With[{fy = u21fy[j, yy]}, (u21ovP[k]/x0ovl)/((det6List/u21psi[tr]) fy)];\nchecks[\"u21: end-to-end MAIN (k, pole set {0..k}, y_k, scanned triple): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|, k = 2,3,4\"] = Table[k -> sizeQ[constDev[u21e2e[k, k, u21ystar[k, wN[[2]]], u21tri]]], {k, u21ks}];\nchecks[\"u21: end-to-end control, wrong y (-63/7, 2), pole set {0..k}\"] = Table[k -> Table[N[constDev[u21e2e[k, k, yy, u21tri]], 3], {yy, {-63/7, 2}}], {k, u21ks}];\nchecks[\"u21: end-to-end control, wrong pole set {0..j} at y_k, j != k\"] = Flatten[Table[{k, j} -> N[constDev[u21e2e[k, j, u21ystar[k, wN[[2]]], u21tri]], 3], {k, u21ks}, {j, DeleteCases[u21ks, k]}]];\nchecks[\"u21: end-to-end control, other triples at y_k, pole set {0..k}\"] = Table[k -> Table[tr -> N[constDev[u21e2e[k, k, u21ystar[k, wN[[2]]], tr]], 3], {tr, {{5, 4, 2}, {4, 3, 1}}}], {k, u21ks}];\nchecks[\"u21: ratio constants (k = 2,3,4)\"] = Table[N[u21e2e[k, k, u21ystar[k, wN[[2]]], u21tri][[1]], 8], {k, u21ks}];\n(* the det2 curve at y_k parallel to c_k on the 14 live entries, exact *)\nchecks[\"u21: det2^{0..k} curve at y_k parallel to c_k (14 live entries, exact)\"] = Table[k -> With[{cv = u21res[Range[0, k]][\"cyx\"] /. ySym -> u21ystar[k, wN[[2]]]}, MatrixRank[{cv, u21cK[k]}] == 1], {k, u21ks}];\nGrid[{{\"triple used, minor pair used\", {u21tri, u21Mpair}}, {\"Phi_k rank (1 = product)\", checks[\"u21: Phi_k product covector (rank of 24x24, exact), k = 2,3,4\"]}, {\"y_k\", Table[u21ystar[k, wN[[2]]], {k, u21ks}]}, {\"MAIN: max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|\", checks[\"u21: end-to-end MAIN (k, pole set {0..k}, y_k, scanned triple): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|, k = 2,3,4\"]}, {\"wrong y controls\", checks[\"u21: end-to-end control, wrong y (-63/7, 2), pole set {0..k}\"]}, {\"wrong pole set controls\", checks[\"u21: end-to-end control, wrong pole set {0..j} at y_k, j != k\"]}, {\"other triples\", checks[\"u21: end-to-end control, other triples at y_k, pole set {0..k}\"]}, {\"curve parallel to c_k at y_k\", checks[\"u21: det2^{0..k} curve at y_k parallel to c_k (14 live entries, exact)\"]}, {\"ratio constants\", checks[\"u21: ratio constants (k = 2,3,4)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
